  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-09-14T01:46:27-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 14, 2017, 1:46 am\">September 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2911\" src=\"/media/archive/9adab80a71e16374029b77a208dd93ab935f94fa5569be916a2b37b08424b30a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"441\" height=\"325\" loading=\"lazy\" />For Art and The Community</h3>\n<p>Want to be more involved with The Guild of Harwich Artists and your community? Join us this nominating year (2018-2020) by filling some of the upcoming open positions:</p>\n<p>President<br />\nVice President<br />\nBoard Member at Large</p>\n<p>Committee Chairs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Annual Christmas Ornament Fundraiser</li>\n<li>Sacrifice Art Sale Fundraiser</li>\n<li>Guild Publicity and Advertising</li>\n<li>Website and Social Media Support</li>\n<li>Bank Exhibit Shows</li>\n<li>Harwich Conservation Trust Wildlands Music &amp; Art Stroll</li>\n<li>Paint The Town</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists, Inc. is a non-profit 501(c)3 organization of Harwich residents and taxpayers who share an interest in visual art. Our mission is to encourage artists and those interested in art through education, fellowship, and exhibitions, and to engage in charitable works that benefit Harwich residents.</p>\n<h3 class=\"font-headlines\">Have a question? Use the contact form below:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f3074-p3349-o1\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"form\">Archived form: submission is not available on this page.</p><div class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" data-source-form=\"disabled\">\n\n\n<p> Your Name (required)<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\"><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" /></span> \n</p>\n<p> Your Email (required)<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\"><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email\" type=\"email\" disabled=\"disabled\" /></span> \n</p>\n<p> Subject<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\"><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" /></span> \n</p>\n<p> Your Message<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\"><textarea rows=\"10\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea\" disabled=\"disabled\"></textarea></span> \n</p>\n\n<p><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Send\" disabled=\"disabled\" />\n</p><p class=\"akismet-fields-container\">Δ<textarea rows=\"8\" disabled=\"disabled\"></textarea>\n</p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-80f205a9f96fc974f661/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich Conservation Trust</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-70233b350e2d7765e1a0/\" rel=\"tag\">Paint the Town</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-6e14e081be09406fa710/\" rel=\"tag\">Sacrifice Art Sale</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4eb958c8ea474845bb0f/\" rel=\"tag\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
